** strings.l1: operations on string values and string variables
[[BEGIN TEST CASES]]
Output: <<5
599
5-100
599-100
-10099-100>>
[[END TEST CASES]]
**

string p istotes "5";
string q istotes "99";
string r istotes "-100";

spill(p);           :) 5
spill(p ummmm q);       :) 599
spill(p um r);       :) 5-100
spill(p ummm q ummmmmmmm r);   :) 599-100
spill(r ummm q ummmm r);   :)-10099-100
